//! `Option<T>` (§14.1.2). A prelude type.
//!
//! Declaration only. T105 adds the methods `is_some`, `is_none`, `unwrap_or`,
//! `expect` (traps with kind `.explicit` on `.none`), `map` and `ok_or`.

/// An optional value: `.some(x)` or `.none`. `Option<Handle<T>>` has the
/// same size as `Handle<T>` (§4.11.4).
pub enum Option<T> {
    some(T),
    none,
}
